=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda  & \\sqrt{7} \\\\ 0 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda  & \\sqrt{7} \\\\ 0 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )-0\\cdot \\sqrt{7} & =0 \\\\ (\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda ) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7fe5a947-f078-594e-9bf7-dde3c2b3ec2f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7fe5a947-f078-594e-9bf7-dde3c2b3ec2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "7fe5a947-f078-594e-9bf7-dde3c2b3ec2f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-f8320f69-edc7-50c1-b592-2506954adc67" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f29c22a6-dc15-5878-997c-e48683c9fce5" "answer-c9ec6264-3ee5-5365-b892-5188665949f4" "answer-70faf1f1-23c6-58e4-bf59-0e879757a31f" "answer-68d692e8-2c9b-54e7-a366-01c7bd296385" "answer-f8320f69-edc7-50c1-b592-2506954adc67"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f29c22a6-dc15-5878-997c-e48683c9fce5" :answer/id #uuid "f29c22a6-dc15-5878-997c-e48683c9fce5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{3}+\\lambda )(1+\\lambda )-\\sqrt{7}=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c9ec6264-3ee5-5365-b892-5188665949f4" :answer/id #uuid "c9ec6264-3ee5-5365-b892-5188665949f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{3}+\\lambda )(1+\\lambda )=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-70faf1f1-23c6-58e4-bf59-0e879757a31f" :answer/id #uuid "70faf1f1-23c6-58e4-bf59-0e879757a31f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{3}+\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-68d692e8-2c9b-54e7-a366-01c7bd296385" :answer/id #uuid "68d692e8-2c9b-54e7-a366-01c7bd296385" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )-\\sqrt{7}=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f8320f69-edc7-50c1-b592-2506954adc67" :answer/id #uuid "f8320f69-edc7-50c1-b592-2506954adc67" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\sqrt{3}-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-8a11188a-8a0f-5ab5-9de2-8d85b1d9c9bc" :question/id #uuid "8a11188a-8a0f-5ab5-9de2-8d85b1d9c9bc" :question/math-academy-id "q-106954" :question/problem "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & -2 \\\\ 2 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & -2 \\\\ 2 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (1-\\lambda )(4-\\lambda )-2\\cdot (-2) & =0 \\\\ 4-\\lambda -4\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+4 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda +8 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5ff74171-fb77-58e8-9b4d-b1ac71573691"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5ff74171-fb77-58e8-9b4d-b1ac71573691" :answer-field/id #uuid "5ff74171-fb77-58e8-9b4d-b1ac71573691" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3be045a5-6b6f-58a1-a9c0-054dd780305c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ee278763-ab63-504f-822f-61b01cf166d4" "answer-bb76f2d9-d38e-5ad5-b5ba-f0c456c42a65" "answer-680fa24a-7dc3-543d-85de-5db5562557f9" "answer-3be045a5-6b6f-58a1-a9c0-054dd780305c" "answer-9a3e29e7-ff34-52ad-a2b3-30b0d4dfc7ea"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee278763-ab63-504f-822f-61b01cf166d4" :answer/id #uuid "ee278763-ab63-504f-822f-61b01cf166d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+4=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bb76f2d9-d38e-5ad5-b5ba-f0c456c42a65" :answer/id #uuid "bb76f2d9-d38e-5ad5-b5ba-f0c456c42a65" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+5\\lambda +8=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-680fa24a-7dc3-543d-85de-5db5562557f9" :answer/id #uuid "680fa24a-7dc3-543d-85de-5db5562557f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda +4=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3be045a5-6b6f-58a1-a9c0-054dd780305c" :answer/id #uuid "3be045a5-6b6f-58a1-a9c0-054dd780305c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-5\\lambda +8=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9a3e29e7-ff34-52ad-a2b3-30b0d4dfc7ea" :answer/id #uuid "9a3e29e7-ff34-52ad-a2b3-30b0d4dfc7ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda +4=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-0b0fd647-11bd-5cf6-9bab-c8f19524ee42" :question/id #uuid "0b0fd647-11bd-5cf6-9bab-c8f19524ee42" :question/math-academy-id "q-107986" :question/problem "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -7 \\\\ 5 & -10\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}2-\\lambda  & -7 \\\\ 5 & -10-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2-\\lambda  & -7 \\\\ 5 & -10-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (2-\\lambda )(-10-\\lambda )-5\\cdot (-7) & =0 \\\\ -20-2\\lambda +10\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+35 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+8\\lambda +15 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7076766c-bcdf-54a7-b381-7806ea7001fb"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7076766c-bcdf-54a7-b381-7806ea7001fb" :answer-field/id #uuid "7076766c-bcdf-54a7-b381-7806ea7001fb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c55c3bab-e95d-5b9c-87f7-f189a3394e07" :answer-field/choices ["answer-eb843c49-7c9d-5188-a745-423ff5070742" "answer-c55c3bab-e95d-5b9c-87f7-f189a3394e07" "answer-8c1e288e-9f0e-5aa1-a99f-65dcd2f40da3" "answer-09d9b377-d154-58c3-9816-cc93e5ae714f" "answer-0213af8b-e153-5a9f-bcae-d28d03ed5a5a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eb843c49-7c9d-5188-a745-423ff5070742" :answer/id #uuid "eb843c49-7c9d-5188-a745-423ff5070742" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+15\\lambda +5=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c55c3bab-e95d-5b9c-87f7-f189a3394e07" :answer/id #uuid "c55c3bab-e95d-5b9c-87f7-f189a3394e07" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+8\\lambda +15=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8c1e288e-9f0e-5aa1-a99f-65dcd2f40da3" :answer/id #uuid "8c1e288e-9f0e-5aa1-a99f-65dcd2f40da3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+8\\lambda -35=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-09d9b377-d154-58c3-9816-cc93e5ae714f" :answer/id #uuid "09d9b377-d154-58c3-9816-cc93e5ae714f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -5=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0213af8b-e153-5a9f-bcae-d28d03ed5a5a" :answer/id #uuid "0213af8b-e153-5a9f-bcae-d28d03ed5a5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda +15=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-c2d1ce53-250c-556e-b39c-e7210e507a13" :question/id #uuid "c2d1ce53-250c-556e-b39c-e7210e507a13" :question/math-academy-id "q-106947" :question/problem "Find the characteristic equation of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 9 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the matrix $\\,A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}4-\\lambda  & 9 \\\\ 2 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThen, the characteristic equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}4-\\lambda  & 9 \\\\ 2 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (4-\\lambda )(-3-\\lambda )-2\\cdot 9 & =0 \\\\ -12-4\\lambda +3\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-18 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda -30 & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e9ffc0b3-2fb7-50ab-863d-ef122a417f29"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e9ffc0b3-2fb7-50ab-863d-ef122a417f29" :answer-field/id #uuid "e9ffc0b3-2fb7-50ab-863d-ef122a417f29" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3a787981-8115-531c-a0b2-45614b628dbe" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e79a4073-0867-556b-8d5c-c5025c11ea29" "answer-d0015afe-6401-5c12-9cf2-8b51092f7180" "answer-fcd3bb9f-f42f-5091-bf4d-48c5dff63db4" "answer-514631b5-18c9-56ed-b862-2cfc925d4f44" "answer-3a787981-8115-531c-a0b2-45614b628dbe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e79a4073-0867-556b-8d5c-c5025c11ea29" :answer/id #uuid "e79a4073-0867-556b-8d5c-c5025c11ea29" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}+\\lambda -30=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d0015afe-6401-5c12-9cf2-8b51092f7180" :answer/id #uuid "d0015afe-6401-5c12-9cf2-8b51092f7180" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-6=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fcd3bb9f-f42f-5091-bf4d-48c5dff63db4" :answer/id #uuid "fcd3bb9f-f42f-5091-bf4d-48c5dff63db4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda +6=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-514631b5-18c9-56ed-b862-2cfc925d4f44" :answer/id #uuid "514631b5-18c9-56ed-b862-2cfc925d4f44" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda -12=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3a787981-8115-531c-a0b2-45614b628dbe" :answer/id #uuid "3a787981-8115-531c-a0b2-45614b628dbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\lambda }^{2}-\\lambda -30=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-0d05d968-12a6-5808-b925-0cd007f4210b" :question/id #uuid "0d05d968-12a6-5808-b925-0cd007f4210b" :question/math-academy-id "q-107982" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix \n$P=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $P-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nP-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(P-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(P-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}1-\\lambda  & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (1-\\lambda )(3-\\lambda )-2\\cdot 4 & =0 \\\\ 3-\\lambda -3\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-8 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-4\\lambda -5 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{4\\pm \\sqrt{(-4)^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot (-5)}}{2\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\pm \\sqrt{36}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\pm 6}{2} \\\\  & =5,-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-1$ and $\\lambda =5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3b447c11-2343-5e3b-9317-039ab756a40a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3b447c11-2343-5e3b-9317-039ab756a40a" :answer-field/id #uuid "3b447c11-2343-5e3b-9317-039ab756a40a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d243faea-e0d3-5179-9ed1-a7f88786cefc" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d243faea-e0d3-5179-9ed1-a7f88786cefc" "answer-956a468e-b06e-5bee-8c3c-ec586866b569" "answer-fa490009-2047-5aaf-930f-ab551852d4a9" "answer-a173a3e7-290e-5032-aef3-774d0ec21fe5" "answer-6ee468a0-d352-5289-a776-61c9098a0f54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d243faea-e0d3-5179-9ed1-a7f88786cefc" :answer/id #uuid "d243faea-e0d3-5179-9ed1-a7f88786cefc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-1$ and $\\lambda =5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-956a468e-b06e-5bee-8c3c-ec586866b569" :answer/id #uuid "956a468e-b06e-5bee-8c3c-ec586866b569" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-5$ and $\\lambda =-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fa490009-2047-5aaf-930f-ab551852d4a9" :answer/id #uuid "fa490009-2047-5aaf-930f-ab551852d4a9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =1$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a173a3e7-290e-5032-aef3-774d0ec21fe5" :answer/id #uuid "a173a3e7-290e-5032-aef3-774d0ec21fe5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =5$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6ee468a0-d352-5289-a776-61c9098a0f54" :answer/id #uuid "6ee468a0-d352-5289-a776-61c9098a0f54" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-95ae8df3-3e3d-5382-b3db-f47a4094753f" :question/id #uuid "95ae8df3-3e3d-5382-b3db-f47a4094753f" :question/math-academy-id "q-12293" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix \n$P=[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -5\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $P-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nP-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-5-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ 1 & -5-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(P-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(P-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-5-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ 1 & -5-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-5-\\lambda )(-5-\\lambda )-1\\cdot 1 & =0 \\\\ 25+5\\lambda +5\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-1 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+10\\lambda +24 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{-10\\pm \\sqrt{{10}^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 24}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\pm \\sqrt{4}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\pm 2}{2} \\\\  & =-6,-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-72630b4f-5b3f-5c7f-b8aa-ef29d3000b9a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-72630b4f-5b3f-5c7f-b8aa-ef29d3000b9a" :answer-field/id #uuid "72630b4f-5b3f-5c7f-b8aa-ef29d3000b9a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c7d63c00-47c6-5ea0-81b5-0ff89c996117" :answer-field/choices ["answer-beb9ae44-9c2f-5ff1-949c-f0430bfe2729" "answer-82038ac4-a96c-5a3c-b35c-2282a0dcbbe1" "answer-c7d63c00-47c6-5ea0-81b5-0ff89c996117" "answer-b88cc7bb-ae8f-5c80-a43e-0886bc245383" "answer-0ee3c296-e699-5a89-9d1d-f1037248664d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-beb9ae44-9c2f-5ff1-949c-f0430bfe2729" :answer/id #uuid "beb9ae44-9c2f-5ff1-949c-f0430bfe2729" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2$ and $\\lambda =4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-82038ac4-a96c-5a3c-b35c-2282a0dcbbe1" :answer/id #uuid "82038ac4-a96c-5a3c-b35c-2282a0dcbbe1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$  (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c7d63c00-47c6-5ea0-81b5-0ff89c996117" :answer/id #uuid "c7d63c00-47c6-5ea0-81b5-0ff89c996117" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b88cc7bb-ae8f-5c80-a43e-0886bc245383" :answer/id #uuid "b88cc7bb-ae8f-5c80-a43e-0886bc245383" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0ee3c296-e699-5a89-9d1d-f1037248664d" :answer/id #uuid "0ee3c296-e699-5a89-9d1d-f1037248664d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-649da0b4-9af9-52b6-817f-cca5e0eb449f" :question/id #uuid "649da0b4-9af9-52b6-817f-cca5e0eb449f" :question/math-academy-id "q-12298" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$U=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 5 \\\\ 4 & -3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $U-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nU-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-2-\\lambda  & 5 \\\\ 4 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(U-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(U-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-2-\\lambda  & 5 \\\\ 4 & -3-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-2-\\lambda )(-3-\\lambda )-5\\cdot 4 & =0 \\\\ 6+2\\lambda +3\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-20 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+5\\lambda -14 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{-5\\pm \\sqrt{{5}^{2}+4\\cdot 1\\cdot 14}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-5\\pm \\sqrt{81}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-5\\pm 9}{2} \\\\  & =-7,2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-7$ and $\\lambda =2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9dde9c69-e4af-5813-b923-f6b3bb4c7cb4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9dde9c69-e4af-5813-b923-f6b3bb4c7cb4" :answer-field/id #uuid "9dde9c69-e4af-5813-b923-f6b3bb4c7cb4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1de09d46-850c-56fb-987f-3452a117032d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-f57eb3c3-c429-58ea-8bc7-183c23c639f6" "answer-c805c3e2-c747-567c-9254-772bf262c4ae" "answer-1de09d46-850c-56fb-987f-3452a117032d" "answer-8eb7b9b2-8faa-570c-b54b-291054c89688" "answer-74c14f3c-9cab-5b7a-ac87-feb91e66599f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f57eb3c3-c429-58ea-8bc7-183c23c639f6" :answer/id #uuid "f57eb3c3-c429-58ea-8bc7-183c23c639f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c805c3e2-c747-567c-9254-772bf262c4ae" :answer/id #uuid "c805c3e2-c747-567c-9254-772bf262c4ae" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-7$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1de09d46-850c-56fb-987f-3452a117032d" :answer/id #uuid "1de09d46-850c-56fb-987f-3452a117032d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-7$ and $\\lambda =2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8eb7b9b2-8faa-570c-b54b-291054c89688" :answer/id #uuid "8eb7b9b2-8faa-570c-b54b-291054c89688" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =7$ and $\\lambda =2$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-74c14f3c-9cab-5b7a-ac87-feb91e66599f" :answer/id #uuid "74c14f3c-9cab-5b7a-ac87-feb91e66599f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186092902 :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}-4 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-4-\\lambda  & 2 \\\\ 6 & 7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(A-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-4-\\lambda  & 2 \\\\ 6 & 7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-4-\\lambda )(7-\\lambda )-2\\cdot 6 & =0 \\\\ -28-7\\lambda +4\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}-12 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-3\\lambda -40 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{3\\pm \\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+4\\cdot 1\\cdot 40}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\pm \\sqrt{169}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\pm 13}{2} \\\\  & =8,-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =8$ and $\\lambda =-5.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186091612 :answer-field/correct "answer-0f9c7839-7769-5b9e-b9cb-6a4582448142" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d968872b-bafd-5fbf-be0b-0478c03ae541" "answer-86cab0f8-b15d-5ea1-8e36-97308b179e3a" "answer-c3c98ca9-4231-5356-a04c-0710da85992a" "answer-0f9c7839-7769-5b9e-b9cb-6a4582448142"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d968872b-bafd-5fbf-be0b-0478c03ae541" :answer/id #uuid "d968872b-bafd-5fbf-be0b-0478c03ae541" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-5$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-86cab0f8-b15d-5ea1-8e36-97308b179e3a" :answer/id #uuid "86cab0f8-b15d-5ea1-8e36-97308b179e3a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-8$ and  $\\lambda =5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c3c98ca9-4231-5356-a04c-0710da85992a" :answer/id #uuid "c3c98ca9-4231-5356-a04c-0710da85992a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =-5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0f9c7839-7769-5b9e-b9cb-6a4582448142" :answer/id #uuid "0f9c7839-7769-5b9e-b9cb-6a4582448142" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =8$ and $\\lambda =-5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-7beb1182-833d-5c48-8b2c-88ca021df959" :question/id #uuid "7beb1182-833d-5c48-8b2c-88ca021df959" :question/math-academy-id "q-12294" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}-8 & 7 \\\\ -9 & 8\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $B-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nB-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 7 \\\\ -9 & 8-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(B-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(B-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 7 \\\\ -9 & 8-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-8-\\lambda )(8-\\lambda )-7\\cdot (-9) & =0 \\\\ -64+8\\lambda -8\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+63 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-1 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda +1)(\\lambda -1) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-1$ and $\\lambda =1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4019788e-b3f0-5d69-b057-88ed3798f2cb"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4019788e-b3f0-5d69-b057-88ed3798f2cb" :answer-field/id #uuid "4019788e-b3f0-5d69-b057-88ed3798f2cb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e9f8b635-dc16-5331-b1fb-d3f18e1d1de5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6b480b06-9772-5260-8335-48075d9da61c" "answer-e9f8b635-dc16-5331-b1fb-d3f18e1d1de5" "answer-2b87526d-2246-50c0-91fd-daa6bec84acf" "answer-b58f6d79-5ae8-55ec-a9dd-9618b7883532" "answer-93f12a44-5d1a-5651-a8b8-32b93c9ffdef"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6b480b06-9772-5260-8335-48075d9da61c" :answer/id #uuid "6b480b06-9772-5260-8335-48075d9da61c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-1$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e9f8b635-dc16-5331-b1fb-d3f18e1d1de5" :answer/id #uuid "e9f8b635-dc16-5331-b1fb-d3f18e1d1de5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-1$ and $\\lambda =1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2b87526d-2246-50c0-91fd-daa6bec84acf" :answer/id #uuid "2b87526d-2246-50c0-91fd-daa6bec84acf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =1$ and $\\lambda =3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b58f6d79-5ae8-55ec-a9dd-9618b7883532" :answer/id #uuid "b58f6d79-5ae8-55ec-a9dd-9618b7883532" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =3$ and $\\lambda =-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-93f12a44-5d1a-5651-a8b8-32b93c9ffdef" :answer/id #uuid "93f12a44-5d1a-5651-a8b8-32b93c9ffdef" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186092903 :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}3-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(A-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}3-\\lambda  & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )(1-\\lambda )+1\\cdot 1 & =0 \\\\ 3-3\\lambda -\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+1 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}-4\\lambda +4 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -2)^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix $A$ has only one eigenvalue $\\lambda =2,$ which is a double root of the characteristic equation." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186091618 :answer-field/correct "answer-89b8c0e6-ae99-51c1-8e85-66f98539ea38" :answer-field/choices ["answer-4a33786d-34fc-5151-8170-2a142f2702df" "answer-18d67bdb-601f-58e7-8b75-d3e4da748215" "answer-89b8c0e6-ae99-51c1-8e85-66f98539ea38" "answer-f1455b86-25c6-5810-8b96-3462621d7ca7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4a33786d-34fc-5151-8170-2a142f2702df" :answer/id #uuid "4a33786d-34fc-5151-8170-2a142f2702df" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2$  (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-18d67bdb-601f-58e7-8b75-d3e4da748215" :answer/id #uuid "18d67bdb-601f-58e7-8b75-d3e4da748215" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =1$ and $\\lambda =4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-89b8c0e6-ae99-51c1-8e85-66f98539ea38" :answer/id #uuid "89b8c0e6-ae99-51c1-8e85-66f98539ea38" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =2$  (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f1455b86-25c6-5810-8b96-3462621d7ca7" :answer/id #uuid "f1455b86-25c6-5810-8b96-3462621d7ca7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =4$ and $\\lambda =4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-6ff2d918-34fd-53ce-9a32-6157ad95bf62" :question/id #uuid "6ff2d918-34fd-53ce-9a32-6157ad95bf62" :question/math-academy-id "q-36781" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$U=[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 5 \\\\ -1 & -7\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $U-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nU-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-7-\\lambda  & 5 \\\\ -1 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(U-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(U-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-7-\\lambda  & 5 \\\\ -1 & -7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-7-\\lambda )(-7-\\lambda )-5\\cdot (-1) & =0 \\\\ 49+7\\lambda +7\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+5 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+14\\lambda +54 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the discriminant of the quadratic equation above, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & ={14}^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 54 \\\\  & =196-216 \\\\  & =-20 \\\\  & <0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the characteristic equation does not have real solutions and therefore $U$ does not have real eigenvalues." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6829d208-f258-5b19-bd9a-4cdd3c37dde5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6829d208-f258-5b19-bd9a-4cdd3c37dde5" :answer-field/id #uuid "6829d208-f258-5b19-bd9a-4cdd3c37dde5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-22ccfd10-2e0b-576f-8601-ee2b077cab77" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7659b379-5d6c-548c-992e-76e7eb504258" "answer-edc626a6-c9de-5b6a-9f82-091af50ae152" "answer-3a1665e4-efa6-5ed5-bd33-ac9a8949a3fe" "answer-29073a5f-e09c-5fc6-ac4e-971be56c9568" "answer-22ccfd10-2e0b-576f-8601-ee2b077cab77"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7659b379-5d6c-548c-992e-76e7eb504258" :answer/id #uuid "7659b379-5d6c-548c-992e-76e7eb504258" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-5$ and $\\lambda =1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-edc626a6-c9de-5b6