ulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a4615f19-9c7a-5091-99a4-538030c0787d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a4615f19-9c7a-5091-99a4-538030c0787d" :answer-field/id #uuid "a4615f19-9c7a-5091-99a4-538030c0787d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-cecd0803-36c1-5916-aeae-507fa6a5a5c6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-75cd4420-20f3-5ded-8c44-39d55a82ae27" "answer-731c273b-83ef-5ecf-bca7-30fd9429facb" "answer-9c38e99e-6b40-58d6-baca-ae8ea0b40eb1" "answer-77ff9bd5-364c-5949-a133-ce7f4bb78ba6" "answer-cecd0803-36c1-5916-aeae-507fa6a5a5c6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-75cd4420-20f3-5ded-8c44-39d55a82ae27" :answer/id #uuid "75cd4420-20f3-5ded-8c44-39d55a82ae27" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-731c273b-83ef-5ecf-bca7-30fd9429facb" :answer/id #uuid "731c273b-83ef-5ecf-bca7-30fd9429facb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9c38e99e-6b40-58d6-baca-ae8ea0b40eb1" :answer/id #uuid "9c38e99e-6b40-58d6-baca-ae8ea0b40eb1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =1$ and $\\lambda =6$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-77ff9bd5-364c-5949-a133-ce7f4bb78ba6" :answer/id #uuid "77ff9bd5-364c-5949-a133-ce7f4bb78ba6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =4$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cecd0803-36c1-5916-aeae-507fa6a5a5c6" :answer/id #uuid "cecd0803-36c1-5916-aeae-507fa6a5a5c6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-688b15c3-44c2-5c91-89ca-dd25252cd049" :question/id #uuid "688b15c3-44c2-5c91-89ca-dd25252cd049" :question/math-academy-id "q-36772" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$L=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 6 \\\\ -9 & -11\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $L-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nL-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}3-\\lambda  & 6 \\\\ -9 & -11-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(L-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(L-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}3-\\lambda  & 6 \\\\ -9 & -11-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (3-\\lambda )(-11-\\lambda )-6\\cdot (-9) & =0 \\\\ -33-3\\lambda +11\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+54 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+8\\lambda +21 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the discriminant of the quadratic equation above, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & ={8}^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 21 \\\\  & =64-84 \\\\  & =-20 \\\\  & <0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the characteristic equation does not have real solutions and therefore $L$ does not have real eigenvalues." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3850d5ad-9421-5f33-bc57-b428d8dacd98"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3850d5ad-9421-5f33-bc57-b428d8dacd98" :answer-field/id #uuid "3850d5ad-9421-5f33-bc57-b428d8dacd98" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-17a34526-21cf-53cf-aa39-d12402af539d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-43843bb9-eeeb-51b0-be25-7866a7b2aeba" "answer-33cfa4f0-b28e-5bca-a516-62e8607d6074" "answer-1fdece1b-ac27-5958-a1d9-138dda9c3a7d" "answer-1143f7a7-3c20-50bb-b995-564624c93a52" "answer-17a34526-21cf-53cf-aa39-d12402af539d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-43843bb9-eeeb-51b0-be25-7866a7b2aeba" :answer/id #uuid "43843bb9-eeeb-51b0-be25-7866a7b2aeba" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =3$ and $\\lambda =-5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-33cfa4f0-b28e-5bca-a516-62e8607d6074" :answer/id #uuid "33cfa4f0-b28e-5bca-a516-62e8607d6074" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =4$ and $\\lambda =5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1fdece1b-ac27-5958-a1d9-138dda9c3a7d" :answer/id #uuid "1fdece1b-ac27-5958-a1d9-138dda9c3a7d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =7$  (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1143f7a7-3c20-50bb-b995-564624c93a52" :answer/id #uuid "1143f7a7-3c20-50bb-b995-564624c93a52" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =9$ and $\\lambda =-6$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17a34526-21cf-53cf-aa39-d12402af539d" :answer/id #uuid "17a34526-21cf-53cf-aa39-d12402af539d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f1a5d1e0-5cd7-522c-a412-852f22ba958a" :question/id #uuid "f1a5d1e0-5cd7-522c-a412-852f22ba958a" :question/math-academy-id "q-107844" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 7\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $A-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nA-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}2-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ -4 & 7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(A-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ -4 & 7-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (2-\\lambda )(7-\\lambda )-0\\cdot (-4) & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -2)(\\lambda -7) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =2$ and $\\lambda =7.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4ce37090-2b25-52bc-8d16-9e6c6c3f75f2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4ce37090-2b25-52bc-8d16-9e6c6c3f75f2" :answer-field/id #uuid "4ce37090-2b25-52bc-8d16-9e6c6c3f75f2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answ