C-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}7-\\lambda  & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (7-\\lambda )(-2-\\lambda )-0\\cdot 0 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda -7)(\\lambda +2) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =7$ and $\\lambda =-2.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-bc20a709-7b8c-57c3-b33e-d46ed2185a69"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-bc20a709-7b8c-57c3-b33e-d46ed2185a69" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc20a709-7b8c-57c3-b33e-d46ed2185a69" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-57e4e92d-8154-5972-94f3-6a2be941a297" :answer-field/choices ["answer-aa4c8e25-fb81-5e27-b673-2b99b02a167e" "answer-57e4e92d-8154-5972-94f3-6a2be941a297" "answer-2a3c3fb8-6cb0-50c4-9ef3-126838f4ce82" "answer-8688b5da-0cea-5d1e-9ba0-2678fa02cf28" "answer-ed046ba9-c6f5-5ba6-8016-8beac476dce8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aa4c8e25-fb81-5e27-b673-2b99b02a167e" :answer/id #uuid "aa4c8e25-fb81-5e27-b673-2b99b02a167e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-57e4e92d-8154-5972-94f3-6a2be941a297" :answer/id #uuid "57e4e92d-8154-5972-94f3-6a2be941a297" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =-2$ and $\\lambda =7$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2a3c3fb8-6cb0-50c4-9ef3-126838f4ce82" :answer/id #uuid "2a3c3fb8-6cb0-50c4-9ef3-126838f4ce82" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =2$ and $\\lambda =7$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8688b5da-0cea-5d1e-9ba0-2678fa02cf28" :answer/id #uuid "8688b5da-0cea-5d1e-9ba0-2678fa02cf28" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\lambda =7$ (double root)" :db/ensure [:answer/vali